# Holder v. Holder (repo rules)

Read **`AGENTS.md`** first. Full rule text lives under **`ops/cursor/rules/`**.

**Non-negotiables**

- No timed gameplay; no wallet-balance watcher as game logic; no offchain winner selection.
- Chain state is source of truth; indexer/DB is projection only.
- No admin or agent custody of user funds; no offchain settlement.
- Solana + Anchor; PDA custody; per-position tracked vaults; strict mint allowlist.

**Process**

- Plan before non-trivial implementation; ADRs in `docs/adr/` for architecture or rule changes.
- Money-path changes need negative tests; use orchestrator handoff template in `ops/cursor/orchestrator/HANDOFF_TEMPLATE.md`.
- Delegate via specialist definitions in `ops/cursor/subagents/`.

**Rule files (read `ops/cursor/rules/`)**

- `00-platform-charter.md` … `06-no-timer-no-offchain-settlement.md`

**Skills** (procedures): `ops/cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md`
